# The non-self-consistent band stage: ICHARG=11 reads the scf stage's CHGCAR and
# keeps it fixed while the eigenvalues are computed along the line-mode KPOINTS of
# the band path. The density-defining tags (PREC, ENCUT, ENAUG, ISPIN, LMAXMIX,
# LASPH, ...) must equal those of INCAR.scf, or the job fails with
# vasp.charge_density_incompatible. The tetrahedron method is not defined on a
# path, so ISMEAR=0. No LORBIT: add LORBIT=11 in a copied template for projected
# bands (no PROCAR is collected).
# EDIFF and EDIFFG are derived from the accuracy_per_atom parameter when not set here.
LWAVE=.FALSE.
LCHARG=.FALSE.
ISTART=0
ICHARG=11
LMAXMIX=6

ISPIN=2

ALGO=Normal
PREC=Accurate
ENCUT=600
ENAUG=900
LREAL=Auto
LASPH=.TRUE.
ADDGRID=.FALSE.
SYMPREC=1e-4

ISMEAR=0
SIGMA=0.05

NELMIN=5
NELM=60

NSW=0
IBRION=-1
